## Every legacy assertion, where it stands now, and its result on this bundle

Generated by `tools/native-acceptance/legacy_map.py` from `docs/architecture/native-checks.json`, `tools/native-acceptance/legacy_assertions.py` (the per-assertion standing: exercised, self-run, ported, retired) and the records under `native/cumulative/` and the root C44 record, after the native stage. A retirement names the suite that holds the behaviour where it survives in the core; that suite result does not stand in for a native assertion. The gate (`acceptance_c44.py`, C44-N01) fails when an exercised, self-run or ported assertion has a target missing or failing on this bundle.

300 legacy assertions: 107 exercised by v2 checks, 97 self-run through legacy_v2, 8 ported into v2 checks, 88 retired with a reason.

